	chapter.7D1AD986DF3F0F6B.title: "Shops and Currency"
	chapter_group.446037D4E661F2F7.title: "Small Goals"
	chapter_group.58A44FB6781AFC03.title: "Tips"
	quest.14EB7346131ED3ED.quest_desc: ["Create rotational power with a water wheel or windmill. It does not need to be a huge factory. If it turns, you have started."]
	quest.14EB7346131ED3ED.title: "Rotating Power"
	quest.1535725BFF7F089F.quest_desc: ["Build a small shop, stall, or service window with a sign, whether or not you are actually selling anything yet."]
	quest.1535725BFF7F089F.title: "A Shop with a Sign"
	quest.21FAEB703BCCB2BC.quest_desc: ["Contribute a little stone, wood, glass, iron, andesite alloy, or other material needed for a community build."]
	quest.21FAEB703BCCB2BC.title: "Material Donation"
	quest.230CDE7D4ED4D6F3.quest_desc: ["The server economy will feel better for longer if it flows through food, decor, building materials, and travel convenience rather than rare gear."]
	quest.230CDE7D4ED4D6F3.title: "Price Tag Etiquette"
	quest.23E0267E295CA8D3.quest_desc: ["Take on one part of the central station project: the site, tracks, platforms, signs, or nearby shops."]
	quest.23E0267E295CA8D3.title: "Central Station Project"
	quest.2402AABC11A06E51.quest_desc: ["Gather glass and lighting materials that work well for stations, market streets, greenhouses, and streetlights."]
	quest.2402AABC11A06E51.title: "Glass and Lighting"
	quest.24D424DE7F64B839.quest_desc: ["If there are Vendors or shop stands, take a look around and get a feel for prices. If not, imagine where they might go later."]
	quest.24D424DE7F64B839.title: "Visit the Market Street"
	quest.256C6CD713B6BF8B.quest_desc: [
		"Iron ingots for the iron factory's Redstone Link, wood for the wood factory's Redstone Link, ..."
		"Hm, what item should this factory use for its Redstone Link frequency?"
		"Try using this. Right-click in the air to set alphabet or special-symbol icons."
	]
	quest.256C6CD713B6BF8B.title: "Making Symbols"
	quest.28816C3EC548A0C7.quest_desc: ["Buy or sell one small item with another player or a server shop. Food, decorations, and railway materials are good light choices."]
	quest.28816C3EC548A0C7.title: "First Trade"
	quest.2A94763C580C3F97.quest_desc: ["Walk around shared spaces such as the central village, market street, and future station area to get a feel for the server."]
	quest.2A94763C580C3F97.title: "First Walk Through Town"
	quest.2C7AAC7F5DD010DC.quest_desc: ["Choose a place you like, maybe by a river, on a hill, or near a planned railway, and leave a small marker there."]
	quest.2C7AAC7F5DD010DC.title: "Choosing a Homesite"
	quest.2CF255D82C3D0978.quest_desc: ["Share a small amount of spare seeds, wood, stone, food, or other low-pressure supplies in shared storage."]
	quest.2CF255D82C3D0978.title: "First Shared Storage Donation"
	quest.2D82F029C414444B.quest_desc: ["This quest book is not required progression. It is a suggested route for server life, so check off only what you feel like doing."]
	quest.2D82F029C414444B.title: "The Quest Book Is Just a Roadmap"
	quest.2EE80A0E96C9F22D.quest_desc: ["Connect shafts and cogwheels, then watch where the rotational power flows."]
	quest.2EE80A0E96C9F22D.title: "Shafts and Cogs"
	quest.2FADC1632E89FE6A.quest_desc: ["Check rotation speed and remaining stress at a glance!"]
	quest.302943D82A47F0F7.title: "Build a Wood Factory"
	quest.36CBC87EF7B5D4A7.quest_desc: ["Make a small farm that gives you food and adds to the village scenery. Automation can wait until later."]
	quest.36CBC87EF7B5D4A7.title: "Small Field"
	quest.3A351D162F3BF6E2.quest_desc: ["Make a map of the area around town, or add useful information to a shared map board. It is a perfect gift for anyone who gets lost."]
	quest.3A351D162F3BF6E2.title: "A Single Map"
	quest.3E6A900F2D83BCBC.quest_desc: [
		"Do you carry a bed around when you travel?"
		"Try taking a sleeping bag instead."
		"It automatically returns to you after you sleep once."
		"It also keeps your spawn point from getting messed up."
		"However, unlike a bed, a sleeping bag cannot set your spawn point."
	]
	quest.3E6A900F2D83BCBC.title: "Make a Sleeping Bag"
	quest.3FCBA3A66424D8F6.quest_desc: ["Imagine a small freight route connecting farms, mines, workshops, and shops. Even better if you actually run it."]
	quest.3FCBA3A66424D8F6.title: "Small Freight Car"
	quest.43E76A72DF7AFC67.quest_desc: ["Display something you brought back from travel, such as rare flowers, saplings, decorative blocks, music discs, or map fragments."]
	quest.43E76A72DF7AFC67.title: "Travel Souvenirs"
	quest.451F7FE7E2D54ED1.quest_desc: ["A building server always needs wood. Contribute logs, planks, fences, stairs, or whatever is useful."]
	quest.451F7FE7E2D54ED1.title: "Wood Delivery"
	quest.480BB91ECCD8E8E8.quest_desc: ["Craft and wear Goggles. They show extra information about Create components."]
	quest.4E8E1C22454D296E.quest_desc: ["Contribute basic Create parts such as andesite alloy, shafts, and cogwheels to a shared workshop or railway project."]
	quest.4E8E1C22454D296E.title: "Basic Create Materials Delivery"
	quest.54795F0341FD6AC9.quest_desc: ["Contribute supplies for railway expansion, such as tracks, sleeper-style blocks, or station decoration materials."]
	quest.54795F0341FD6AC9.title: "Railway Supply"
	quest.55B6C7DE9C158127.quest_desc: ["Add one shared plaza detail where people can pass through, such as benches, a well, a notice board, or a small garden."]
	quest.55B6C7DE9C158127.title: "Central Plaza"
	quest.57E31749DE3C0E7A.quest_desc: ["Plan or start a railway connection to another home, the edge of town, an exploration outpost, or a scenic spot."]
	quest.57E31749DE3C0E7A.title: "To the Next Station"
	quest.58B517AA73C37C72.quest_desc: ["Choose a train name, destination, direction sign, or timetable. Railways feel alive once they have information attached."]
	quest.58B517AA73C37C72.title: "Timetable and Destination"
	quest.5CF713ED40D61E7E.quest_desc: ["Place some track yourself, even if it is short. A mini line in town, a workshop connection, or a test railway all count."]
	quest.5CF713ED40D61E7E.title: "First Track"
	quest.5D010440508DE579.quest_desc: ["Find a notable structure such as a village, mineshaft, ruin, or dungeon, then leave coordinates or directions."]
	quest.5D010440508DE579.title: "Structure Visit Log"
	quest.5DF7D742569FF7A0.quest_desc: ["This is an example delivery quest for filling shared storage or a shop with basic food such as bread, wheat, potatoes, or carrots."]
	quest.5DF7D742569FF7A0.title: "Bread and Food Delivery"
	quest.5E9BDFE9287C2A6F.quest_desc: ["Improve shared storage with labels, sorting, containers, decorations, or anything else that makes it easier to use."]
	quest.5E9BDFE9287C2A6F.title: "Improve Shared Storage"
	quest.5EA32CC3DBB8F168.quest_desc: ["Add lanterns, torches, fences, or other safety details around your home or along village paths."]
	quest.5EA32CC3DBB8F168.title: "Light the Night Paths"
	quest.5F0AEBCF79718A87.quest_desc: ["Peace on a multiplayer server starts with a bed. Set up a place to sleep, whether near spawn or in your own home."]
	quest.5F0AEBCF79718A87.title: "First Bed"
	quest.60E51B6B2A459216.quest_desc: ["Build something that gives the village a story, such as a mill, smithy, cafe, fishing spot, or small greenhouse."]
	quest.60E51B6B2A459216.title: "One Themed Building"
	quest.6365DA31713A48D1.quest_desc: ["Leave names, a date, or a short note on a finished community build. That is how the server's history builds up."]
	quest.6365DA31713A48D1.title: "Commemorative Marker"
	quest.66FADED6F96CF300.quest_desc: ["Improve one part of your house, such as the roof, windows, chimney, or entrance, so it blends naturally into the village."]
	quest.66FADED6F96CF300.title: "Give Your House Some Character"
	quest.673023461E0B9AA5.quest_desc: ["Look over the basic Create: Numismatics items and currency flow. Money on this server is a small seasoning for convenience and trade."]
	quest.673023461E0B9AA5.title: "Currency Guide"
	quest.6C9B85749DA96779.quest_desc: ["Finish a small Create workshop with power, processing machines, storage, and a crafting area."]
	quest.6C9B85749DA96779.title: "Finish a Small Workshop"
	quest.6E92A0A647424DD2.quest_desc: ["Move items with a belt and you will quickly see why Create is fun. Start short and tidy."]
	quest.6E92A0A647424DD2.title: "One Belt Line"
	quest.6EA2701ED8885776.quest_desc: ["Add paths, fences, or streetlights to the front of your home or a village alley. Small details make the server's atmosphere."]
	quest.6EA2701ED8885776.title: "Roads and Streetlights"
	quest.6F8437ACFA1D888D.quest_desc: ["Even a platform that is only a few blocks wide counts. Add signs and lighting, and it already feels like a station."]
	quest.6F8437ACFA1D888D.title: "Small Platform"
	quest.70B5A39CED0E44D4.quest_desc: ["Claim a small amount of currency as an early welcome gift. Money is not the goal; it just makes shops and exchange smoother."]
	quest.70B5A39CED0E44D4.title: "Small Settlement Grant"
	quest.72FD7788D20A21C5.quest_desc: ["Visit a biome you have not seen yet, and record any natural materials or screenshot spots you like."]
	quest.72FD7788D20A21C5.title: "Unfamiliar Biome"
	quest.799BB64CFA30EE68.quest_desc: ["Decide what you want to sell, the price, how you will restock it, and what the shop should look like. It does not need to be a huge automated shop."]
	quest.799BB64CFA30EE68.title: "Preparing My Shop"
	quest.7B38CC0443795C65.quest_desc: ["Supply water to this press and stamp one set at a time."]
	quest.7E45914A6803EF41.quest_desc: ["Make your first processing line with a press and depot."]
	quest.7E45914A6803EF41.title: "Press and Depot"
	quest.7E7F4EA2F0C75880.quest_desc: ["Make the area around a Nether portal safer, or add signs and lighting to a shared Nether route."]
	quest.7E7F4EA2F0C75880.title: "Nether Passage"
	quest.7E8F4B886AA841F6.quest_desc: ["Leave an idea for the next shared build on the notice board: a harbor, market, scenic railway, park, hot spring, lookout, and so on."]
	quest.7E8F4B886AA841F6.title: "Suggest the Next Project"
